hanaworlds-shell-ui 0.1.0

HanaWorlds Shell UI was extracted from
https://github.com/yzsnstotz/hanaworlds-desktop
commit bd964cdf19785b14aa1e2f6d2a2ee350190a038f,
packages/client/ui-hanaworlds-shell. The original MIT license is included in LICENSE.
Copyright (c) 2026 DeepSeek. HanaWorlds adaptations: HanaWorlds contributors.

DSH client registration and build format derive from deepseek-ai/deepseek-harness,
dsh-v0.2.0-rc.2 (MIT). Cordis 4.0.4 and its public services are Host-provided.
React 18 panels use the Host React module table; React is not duplicated in this bundle.
The blossom image is retained verbatim from the specified HanaWorlds baseline.

